_speed", "label": "Builder speed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/features/auto-playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DJ-app BPM and rating come from an index built once per import change: opening went from 2.2 s to 0.1 s and generating takes 0.14 s on an 8.8k library."}, {"id": "vault_features_auto_playlists_avoid_recent", "label": "Avoid songs played in recent shows", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/features/auto-playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Planned under Later: avoid songs played in recent shows and sessions; the options are stored on each generated playlist for that and for generate again."}, {"id": "vault_features_auto_playlists_tempo_ramp", "label": "Tempo ramp", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/features/auto-playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Start and end BPM along a straight ramp; Tempo follows the flow bends the ramp to the flow's shape instead."}, {"id": "vault_features_auto_playlists_seed_tracks", "label": "Starting tracks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/features/auto-playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "With several tracks selected, the first in table order starts the set and all the others are included; the songs to start from are placed by role, not put first."}], "edges": [{"source": "vault_features_auto_playlists_feature", "target": "vault_adr_0029_automatic_playlists_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/features/auto-playlists.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_features_auto_playlists_feature", "target": "vault_ad